WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.964 --> 00:00:16.730
Bajie Wujing swung their weapons at the demon.

2
00:00:18.311 --> 00:00:19.151
The demon laughed.

3
00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:21.973
"I'm much too powerful for you!"

4
00:00:23.093 --> 00:00:25.674
From inside the cymbals, Wukong heard the fight.

5
00:00:26.675 --> 00:00:29.296
He heard grunts and the sounds of weapons clashing.

6
00:00:30.592 --> 00:00:32.473
The Tang Monk cried, "No!"

7
00:00:33.674 --> 00:00:34.955
Then there was silence.

8
00:00:36.616 --> 00:00:38.116
happened out there?"

9
00:00:38.297 --> 00:00:39.117
shouted Wukong.

10
00:00:39.557 --> 00:00:40.518
There was no answer.

11
00:00:42.419 --> 00:00:46.181
The monkey punched and kicked the inside of the cymbals for hours.

12
00:00:48.903 --> 00:00:51.644
But the two cymbals would not come apart.

13
00:00:53.645 --> 00:00:55.607
is terrible," he said to himself.

14
00:00:55.627 --> 00:00:59.200
"How will I get out of here?"

15
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:02.782
The monkey was about to strike the cymbals again when he heard a voice.

16
00:01:02.802 --> 00:01:05.524
"Wukong, are you in there?"

17
00:01:05.544 --> 00:01:07.725
"Who is that?"

18
00:01:08.005 --> 00:01:08.825
Wukong asked.

19
00:01:08.845 --> 00:01:11.847
"I'm the Gold Dragon," said the voice.

20
00:01:11.867 --> 00:01:14.809
"The Jade Emperor sent me to help you.

21
00:01:15.629 --> 00:01:18.511
I'll wedge my horn between the cymbals and pry them apart."

22
00:01:23.093 --> 00:01:24.654
hurry!" said Wukong.

23
00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:28.256
Slowly the dragon's horn poked through.

24
00:01:29.356 --> 00:01:32.579
But the cymbals were still tightly clasped together.

25
00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.801
Wukong groaned.

26
00:01:34.821 --> 00:01:36.462
"I can't escape."

27
00:01:36.482 --> 00:01:41.026
"Maybe we can find another way to pry the cymbals apart," said the dragon.

28
00:01:41.046 --> 00:01:44.749
"Actually, I have a different idea," said the monkey.

29
00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:48.272
Wukong turned his iron bar into a drill.

30
00:01:51.134 --> 00:01:53.136
He made a hole in the dragon's horn.

31
00:01:56.896 --> 00:02:00.258
Then he made himself tiny and climbed into the hole.

32
00:02:00.278 --> 00:02:03.481
"Pull your horn out now!"

33
00:02:03.741 --> 00:02:04.541
said Wukong.

34
00:02:06.863 --> 00:02:10.606
The dragon pulled and pulled and finally got his horn out.

35
00:02:12.787 --> 00:02:16.490
The monkey jumped out of the hole and returned to his normal size.

36
00:02:18.731 --> 00:02:19.992
you," said Wukong.

37
00:02:20.012 --> 00:02:21.994
"Now we must free my friends."

38
00:02:23.195 --> 00:02:24.896
have to be quiet," said the dragon.

39
00:02:25.644 --> 00:02:26.785
"The demon is sleeping."

40
00:02:28.547 --> 00:02:32.310
nodded. Then he turned toward the cymbals and raised his iron bar.

41
00:02:35.092 --> 00:02:36.253
The cymbals shattered.

42
00:02:36.273 --> 00:02:38.915
"Why did you do that?"

43
00:02:39.115 --> 00:02:39.896
cried the dragon.

44
00:02:41.077 --> 00:02:41.998
Wukong shrugged.

45
00:02:42.018 --> 00:02:42.978
"I was angry."

46
00:02:43.939 --> 00:02:45.440
demon stormed into the room.

47
00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.642
"Sun Wukong!

48
00:02:48.083 --> 00:02:49.183
How did you escape?"

49
00:02:50.705 --> 00:02:51.185
are you?"

50
00:02:51.525 --> 00:02:52.546
demanded Wukong.

51
00:02:52.566 --> 00:02:56.060
"How do you know my name?"

52
00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.863
"My name is Yellow Brows," said the demon.

53
00:02:58.883 --> 00:03:03.266
"I've been waiting for you and the Tang Monk to pass by my mountain."

54
00:03:04.287 --> 00:03:05.748
Wukong narrowed his eyes.

55
00:03:05.768 --> 00:03:09.731
"Why?" "I'm a Buddhist," said the demon.

56
00:03:09.751 --> 00:03:14.554
"I plan to go to the Western Paradise and get the True Scriptures myself."

57
00:03:14.574 --> 00:03:17.336
"You can't do that!"

58
00:03:17.657 --> 00:03:18.537
shouted Wukong.

59
00:03:19.158 --> 00:03:21.520
The monkey and the dragon charged toward the demon.

60
00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.643
The demon pulled a cloth from his robe and threw it.

61
00:03:28.345 --> 00:03:32.888
The cloth wrapped around Wukong and the dragon, and then became very small.

62
00:03:36.772 --> 00:03:38.253
Soon they were tied up in a room.

63
00:03:39.033 --> 00:03:42.536
The Tang Monk, Bajie, and Wujing were also in the room.

64
00:03:43.437 --> 00:03:45.158
Their bags were lying in a corner.

65
00:03:45.178 --> 00:03:49.122
"I'm sorry for not believing you, Wukong," said the Tang Monk.

66
00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:51.544
"You suspected this place was dangerous."

67
00:03:52.768 --> 00:03:55.049
"Don't worry about that, Master," said the monkey.

68
00:03:55.069 --> 00:03:58.050
"We must escape as soon as the demon goes back to sleep.

69
00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:00.990
He plans to get the True Scriptures himself."

70
00:04:03.431 --> 00:04:04.891
The group waited for a while.

71
00:04:06.432 --> 00:04:10.513
Finally Wukong made himself tiny and slipped out from his ropes.

72
00:04:11.473 --> 00:04:13.794
He untied his companions and the dragon.

73
00:04:15.535 --> 00:04:16.875
go," the monkey whispered.

74
00:04:16.895 --> 00:04:18.855
"Bajie, get the bags."

75
00:04:18.935 --> 00:04:22.817
"Everyone, be quiet," the dragon warned.

76
00:04:24.978 --> 00:04:28.319
They tiptoed through the monastery and were soon outside.

77
00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.921
looked at Bajie and frowned.

78
00:04:31.941 --> 00:04:33.542
"Where are the bags?"

79
00:04:34.862 --> 00:04:35.563
pig moaned.

80
00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:38.084
"I forgot them."

81
00:04:39.244 --> 00:04:41.325
"Master's special robe is in one of those bags!"

82
00:04:41.905 --> 00:04:42.866
Wukong sighed.

83
00:04:45.367 --> 00:04:45.767
"Wait here.

84
00:04:46.127 --> 00:04:47.348
I'll go back in and get them."

85
00:04:50.208 --> 00:04:53.530
The monkey quietly hurried back to the room and grabbed the bags.

86
00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:57.872
But as he was leaving, he tripped and knocked over a statue.

87
00:04:59.973 --> 00:05:03.294
From another room Yellow Brows shouted, "What was that?"

88
00:05:04.335 --> 00:05:05.395
Wukong gulped.

89
00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:07.056
"Uh-oh."
